<title>MEXICO: Mexico foreign portfolio investment up in Jan.</title>
<headline>Mexico foreign portfolio investment up in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investment in Mexican securities rose 7.35 percent in January to $36.9 billion from $34.37 billion on Dec. 31, the Mexican Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said foreign investment in stocks rose 8.75 percent to $33.69 billion, while in the money market it fell 5.39 percent to $3.21 billion.  </p>
<p>				  Jan     Dec     Monthly     Yearly</p>
<p>	 31	31	Change     Change</p>
