<p>Neutral Fund	(2)     3.962   3.507   12.99	 12.99</p>
<p>ADRs		  (3)    17.086  15.108   13.09	 13.09</p>
<p>Mexico Fund	 (4)     0.981   0.920    6.58	  6.58</p>
